<description>&lt;p&gt;Armed Naga militants continue operations in Manipur’s Noney district, engaging in clashes with security forces and seizing weapons while rival Naga groups also fought, leaving three dead. Thousands of Tangkhul Nagas rallied in Ukhrul and Kamjong demanding the withdrawal of Assam Rifles and the abrogation of the SoO pact. In Kashmir, IGP Sujit Kumar warned that drug-trade profits are funding terrorist networks and IGP Kashmir said security forces are prepared for all contingencies amid terror threats, while soldiers celebrated Diwali along the LoC under heightened vigilance. The UCDP recorded 437 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;India Education Diary&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxNMnJSOXdJMHZzY0llRklFS2dZdTZZZzRvbFk0T0FxdV9NTGQ0RUpKMnpyNkNSTk5Hbi1fZzdoekJjUmdqc0xPbHNIa1Z3SUd0Wms0NlV2LVlSajB5b29fb0tpTkJjMmFyUzZBMndYX2pQdVBNTm53MjRLdVNYOE9ISzdmRUpUeWZRemRJcEFfOHZ5bG9sWkU3NQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir Convener&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of India&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of India&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxNU2ZjZ3pXOW9xYlBPSGlnVzI2TkVUaUh3dlljUFNITmN5QlE0akV4cmRINnJRbXYyOEtrUWVJN2F4YzJzWndqNXJISXhXbTdha2U4ck50Tk51OS1neWluMFNEeFFxT1Q0N19RNGZVMlFwaE1wdE1OQmJlX2FQVzFoeHByLWVoaEhjNkV5QUMwSzBSS3FoU0VPTHY3amlZRzJlUFlHMkNxWmhrYzVPcHJ4MWo0ak1zV0E?oc=5&quot;&gt;NorthEast India24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sambad English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Org